THEN EXTROPY INSTITUTE IS FOR YOU! 
 
	Technological and social change continue to accelerate,  
thrusting us into a future of unprecedented possibility and choice.   
Increasingly, gerontologists agree that aging will be partly or wholly  
controlled in the next few decades.  Drastic extension of the human  
lifespan will be accompanied by the ability to radically increase human  
intelligence using advanced nootropics (smart drugs) and neurological  
